---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "矿业用丝网：筛网、振动筛与采石场应用";
const description = "矿业和骨料加工丝网技术指南。涵盖筛网类型、材料选择、磨损因素和高耐用筛网采购。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">矿业与骨料用丝网</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        矿业筛网面临极端的磨损、冲击和腐蚀。选择合适的
        网材类型和材料会极大影响处理量和运行成本。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 
    <span>应用领域</span> / 
    矿业
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">矿业应用概览</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        丝网在矿业和骨料加工中承担着关键的筛分和分级任务。从
        初级破碎机前的预先筛分到最终产品
        分级，筛网性能直接决定工厂效率。
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        常见矿业应用：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>预先筛分</strong> — 在初级破碎前去除过大物料</li>
        <li><strong>振动筛</strong> — 骨料厂的粒度分级</li>
        <li><strong>滚筒筛</strong> — 用于洗矿和分级的旋转滚筒</li>
        <li><strong>破碎机筛网</strong> — 用于初级和二级破碎机的重型筛网</li>
        <li><strong>脱水筛</strong> — 去除处理后物料中的水分</li>
        <li><strong>弧形筛</strong> — 用于精细分级的静态弧形筛面</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Screen Types -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">矿业筛网类型</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">编织筛网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            传统的方形或矩形孔编织网。柔韧、安装方便，
            可提供高碳钢材质。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 初始成本低</li>
            <li>+ 可加工很大尺寸</li>
            <li>+ 合适的丝径可自清洁</li>
            <li>− 耐磨寿命低于合成筛材</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">挂钩筛网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            带预成型边缘（挂钩）的编织网，用于张紧安装在振动
            筛筛板上。骨料厂最常见。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 安装和更换快捷</li>
            <li>+ 保持适当张紧</li>
            <li>+ 振动筛标准配置</li>
            <li>− 极端冲击下挂钩可能失效</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">琴弦线筛网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            只有纵向丝（或极少横向丝）。高开孔率，
            非常适合粘性或湿物料。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 40-50% 开孔率（编织网为 30-40%）</li>
            <li>+ 粘性矿石防堵孔</li>
            <li>+ 更高处理量</li>
            <li>− 分级精度较低</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">自清洁筛网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mb-2">
            采用交替波纹或异形丝编织，产生振动，
            防止物料堆积。
          </p>
          <ul class="text-sm text-theme-secondary space-y-1">
            <li>+ 减少堵孔和卡孔</li>
            <li>+ 湿筛时保持开孔率</li>
            <li>+ 有效使用寿命更长</li>
            <li>− 初始成本较高</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Material Selection -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">矿业材料选择</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        矿业筛网材料必须平衡耐磨性、韧性和成本：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">材料</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">硬度</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">抗拉强度</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">适用场景</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">高碳钢</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">中等</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1600-1800 MPa</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">普通骨料、砾石</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">65Mn（锰钢）</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">高（加工硬化）</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1800-2200 MPa</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">重冲击、高磨蚀性矿石</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">304 不锈钢</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">中等</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1500-1700 MPa</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">腐蚀环境、湿筛</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">油淬火丝</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">高</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">1900-2100 MPa</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">高张力应用</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-accent">
          <strong>关键洞察：</strong>65Mn 锰钢在冲击下会加工硬化，
          使用中变得更硬。这使其成为初级破碎和
          高冲击筛分的理想选择，尽管初始成本较高。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Wear Factors -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">影响筛网寿命的因素</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        了解磨损机理有助于优化筛网选择和更换时机：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>磨蚀</strong> — 物料滑动导致丝径逐渐变细。干筛中的主要磨损形式。</li>
        <li><strong>冲击</strong> — 大物料坠落造成断丝。预先筛分和初级筛分中的主要问题。</li>
        <li><strong>腐蚀</strong> — 潮湿或酸性环境中的化学侵蚀。需用不锈钢或镀层丝。</li>
        <li><strong>疲劳</strong> — 振动引起的循环载荷。张紧不当会加剧疲劳。</li>
        <li><strong>堵孔/糊孔</strong> — 物料卡在孔中，降低开孔率并增加局部应力。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Sizing -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">筛网尺寸与规格</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        矿业筛网通常按以下参数指定：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>孔径</strong> — 方形（如 25mm）或矩形（如 50×75mm）</li>
        <li><strong>丝径</strong> — 越粗的丝寿命越长，但开孔率越低</li>
        <li><strong>筛板尺寸</strong> — 标准宽度（1m、1.5m、2m），长度可定制</li>
        <li><strong>边缘处理</strong> — 平边、挂钩边或加强边</li>
        <li><strong>开孔率</strong> — 影响处理量和堵孔倾向</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        使用我们的<a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">焊接网计算器</a>估算
        筛网重量以便物流规划，编织筛网可用<a href="/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">编织网计算器</a>。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Sourcing -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">矿业筛网采购</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">提供工况条件</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            提供物料硬度、粒度分布、含水率
            和处理量。这决定了最优丝径和孔径。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">验证丝材质量</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            索取钢厂质保书，确认抗拉强度和丝材成分。
            不合格丝材会过早失效，导致非计划停机。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-theme-accent pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">考虑总成本，而非单价</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            高端筛网可能贵 30-50%，但寿命延长 2-3 倍。请计算
            每吨筛分成本，而非每块筛板成本。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">继续探索</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">焊接丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">重型焊接网规格</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/applications/concrete/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">混凝土用丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">建筑与基础设施应用</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/anping-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">安平丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">矿业筛网制造中心</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/factories/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">工厂目录</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">浏览矿业筛网制造商</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">需要矿业筛网？</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">发送您的工况规格，我们将为您对接合格的制造商。</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        提交询盘
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
